window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a424-a2ce66f30243ea1d.json"]={sha256:"a2ce66f30243ea1d5c1d7ba63688c4a46ff3776e547df0aec5a1b64fb7165a46",value:{"id":"a424","title":"數位全像顯微鏡","titleEn":"Digital holographic microscopy","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從物光與參考光在感測器上形成的離軸干涉條紋出發，理解載波頻率如何讓單張全像圖分離出複數波前，再把相位展開、光源同調、物鏡曲率補償、折射率與波長校正、雜訊預算和數值重聚焦整合成可驗收的定量相位顯微工程。","summaryEn":"Start from the off-axis interference fringes that object and reference beams form on the sensor, see how the carrier frequency lets a single hologram yield the complex wavefront, then integrate phase unwrapping, source coherence, objective-curvature compensation, refractive-index and wavelength calibration, noise budgets and numerical refocusing into an acceptable quantitative-phase microscope.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-modulation-holography","subcategoryTitle":"光調制、顯示與全像","subcategoryTitleEn":"Light modulation, displays and holography","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-modulation-holography","learningTags":["optics","optics-modulation-holography","microscope"],"architectureFamily":"microscope","architectureNodes":[["雷射與分光器","Laser and beam splitter"],["物光臂與顯微物鏡","Object arm and microscope objective"],["參考臂延遲線","Reference-arm delay line"],["離軸全像感測器","Off-axis hologram sensor"],["數值重建與相位展開","Numerical reconstruction and unwrapping"],["定量相位影像","Quantitative phase image"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[0,2],[1,3],[2,3],[3,4],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"microscope","labels":["雷射與分光器","物光臂與顯微物鏡","參考臂延遲線","離軸全像感測器","數值重建與相位展開"],"labelsEn":["Laser and beam splitter","Object arm and microscope objective","Reference-arm delay line","Off-axis hologram sensor","Numerical reconstruction and unwrapping"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：λ = 532 nm、像素 3.45 µm、40×/0.65 物鏡。物光頻寬半寬 f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm，選 3 像素條紋 Λ = 10.35 µm 得 f_c = 96.6 lp/mm，滿足 f_c ≥ 3·f_max = 92 lp/mm 與 f_c + f_max = 127 lp/mm ≤ 145 lp/mm，參考光角度 θ = asin(0.532×0.0966) ≈ 2.95°。反射式量一個 400 nm 台階：Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad，包裹後為 9.45 − 12.57 = −3.12 rad，若不展開會讀成 −132 nm。加入 561 nm 第二波長，合成波長 Λ = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm，合成相位 4π×0.400/10.29 ≈ 0.489 rad 不會包裹，反算高度 0.489×10.29/(4π) = 0.400 µm。但合成波長把相位雜訊放大 Λ/λ ≈ 19 倍：σ_φ = 10 mrad 時單波長 σ_h ≈ 0.42 nm，合成波長 σ_h ≈ 8.2 nm，所以用合成波長決定 2π 級數、再用單波長取得細節。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Design exercise: λ = 532 nm, 3.45 µm pixels, 40×/0.65 objective. The object half-bandwidth is f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm; choosing 3-pixel fringes Λ = 10.35 µm gives f_c = 96.6 lp/mm, satisfying f_c ≥ 3·f_max = 92 lp/mm and f_c + f_max = 127 lp/mm ≤ 145 lp/mm, with reference angle θ = asin(0.532×0.0966) ≈ 2.95°. Measuring a 400 nm step in reflection: Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad, which wraps to 9.45 − 12.57 = −3.12 rad and reads as −132 nm if not unwrapped. Adding a 561 nm second wavelength gives Λ = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm; the synthetic phase 4π×0.400/10.29 ≈ 0.489 rad does not wrap and returns 0.489×10.29/(4π) = 0.400 µm. The synthetic wavelength amplifies phase noise by Λ/λ ≈ 19, so with σ_φ = 10 mrad the single-wavelength σ_h ≈ 0.42 nm becomes about 8.2 nm; use the synthetic wavelength to fix the 2π order and the single wavelength for detail. Values are teaching assumptions.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a424-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「離軸全像記錄與載波頻率」與「相位與光程差、包裹與展開」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency\" and \"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a424-v12-01","title":"離軸全像記錄與載波頻率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Off-axis fringes and the sensor” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"數位全像顯微鏡用相機記錄物光 O 與參考光 R 的干涉強度 I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R。若參考光以角度 θ 斜射，交叉項帶有空間載波 sinθ/λ，在頻譜中把 +1 階（含完整複數物光）、−1 階與零階分開；數值濾波取出 +1 階後就能同時得到振幅與相位。載波必須夠高才能分離三項，卻又不能高到讓條紋週期小於兩個像素而違反取樣定理。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A digital holographic microscope records on a camera the interference intensity of object wave O and reference wave R, I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R. When the reference arrives at an angle θ, the cross terms carry a spatial carrier sinθ/λ that separates the +1 order, which contains the full complex object wave, from the −1 order and the zero order in the spectrum; filtering out the +1 order numerically gives amplitude and phase at once. The carrier must be high enough to separate the three terms yet low enough that the fringe period stays above two pixels, otherwise sampling fails. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Off-axis fringes and the sensor”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：物光在像面的頻寬半寬為 f_max = NA/(M·λ)；取 40×/0.65 物鏡、λ = 532 nm，f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The image-plane half-bandwidth of the object wave is f_max = NA/(M·λ); for a 40×/0.65 objective at λ = 532 nm, f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Off-axis fringes and the sensor”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-01-k1","title":"離軸全像記錄與載波頻率","titleEn":"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency","text":"數位全像顯微鏡用相機記錄物光 O 與參考光 R 的干涉強度 I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R。若參考光以角度 θ 斜射，交叉項帶有空間載波 sinθ/λ，在頻譜中把 +1 階（含完整複數物光）、−1 階與零階分開；數值濾波取出 +1 階後就能同時得到振幅與相位。","textEn":"A digital holographic microscope records on a camera the interference intensity of object wave O and reference wave R, I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R. When the reference arrives at an angle θ, the cross terms carry a spatial carrier sinθ/λ that separates the +1 order, which contains the full complex object wave, from the −1 order and the zero order in the spectrum; filtering out the +1 order numerically gives amplitude and phase at once.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「離軸全像記錄與載波頻率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency\" is correct?","options":["載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","數位全像顯微鏡用相機記錄物光 O 與參考光 R 的干涉強度 I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R。","只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。"],"optionsEn":["A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","A digital holographic microscope records on a camera the interference intensity of object wave O and reference wave R, I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R.","If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity."],"answer":1,"explanation":"數位全像顯微鏡用相機記錄物光 O 與參考光 R 的干涉強度 I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A digital holographic microscope records on a camera the interference intensity of object wave O and reference wave R, I = |O|² + |R|² + OR* + O*R. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a424-v12-02","title":"離軸全像記錄與載波頻率：定量估算","titleEn":"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Off-axis fringes and the sensor” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：物光在像面的頻寬半寬為 f_max = NA/(M·λ)；取 40×/0.65 物鏡、λ = 532 nm，f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm。分離條件 f_c ≥ 3·f_max ≈ 92 lp/mm，取樣條件 f_c + f_max ≤ 1/(2p)；像素 p = 3.45 µm 時上限 145 lp/mm。選 3 像素條紋 Λ = 10.35 µm，f_c = 96.6 lp/mm，θ = asin(λ·f_c) = asin(0.0514) ≈ 2.95°，兩個條件都滿足。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The image-plane half-bandwidth of the object wave is f_max = NA/(M·λ); for a 40×/0.65 objective at λ = 532 nm, f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm. Separation needs f_c ≥ 3·f_max ≈ 92 lp/mm and sampling needs f_c + f_max ≤ 1/(2p), which for p = 3.45 µm pixels is 145 lp/mm. Choosing 3-pixel fringes, Λ = 10.35 µm, gives f_c = 96.6 lp/mm and θ = asin(λ·f_c) = asin(0.0514) ≈ 2.95°, satisfying both. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：對一張空白區域全像圖做二維傅立葉轉換，量 +1 階中心到零階的距離並換算成 lp/mm，與 λ·sinθ 的設計值比較；再檢查 +1 階與零階邊緣之間是否留有空隙，並確認 +1 階完全落在奈奎斯特邊界內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take the 2D Fourier transform of a hologram of an empty field, measure the distance from the +1 order centre to the zero order in lp/mm and compare with the design value sinθ/λ; then check that a gap remains between the +1 order and the edge of the zero-order lobe and that the +1 order lies entirely inside the Nyquist boundary.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"物光在像面的頻寬半寬為 f_max = NA/(M·λ)；取 40×/0.65 物鏡、λ = 532 nm，f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm。分離條件 f_c ≥ 3·f_max ≈ 92 lp/mm，取樣條件 f_c + f_max ≤ 1/(2p)；像素 p = 3.45 µm 時上限 145 lp/mm。選 3 像素條紋 Λ = 10.35 µm，f_c = 96.6 lp/mm，θ = asin(λ·f_c) = asin(0.0514) ≈ 2.95°，兩個條件都滿足。","textEn":"The image-plane half-bandwidth of the object wave is f_max = NA/(M·λ); for a 40×/0.65 objective at λ = 532 nm, f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm. Separation needs f_c ≥ 3·f_max ≈ 92 lp/mm and sampling needs f_c + f_max ≤ 1/(2p), which for p = 3.45 µm pixels is 145 lp/mm. Choosing 3-pixel fringes, Λ = 10.35 µm, gives f_c = 96.6 lp/mm and θ = asin(λ·f_c) = asin(0.0514) ≈ 2.95°, satisfying both.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「離軸全像記錄與載波頻率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency\", which statement holds?","options":["數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。","相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。","物光在像面的頻寬半寬為 f_max = NA/(M·λ)。"],"optionsEn":["Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.","Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.","The image-plane half-bandwidth of the object wave is f_max = NA/(M·λ); for a 40×/0.65 objective at λ = 532 nm, f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"物光在像面的頻寬半寬為 f_max = NA/(M·λ)；取 40×/0.65 物鏡、λ = 532 nm，f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The image-plane half-bandwidth of the object wave is f_max = NA/(M·λ); for a 40×/0.65 objective at λ = 532 nm, f_max = 0.65/(40×0.532 µm) ≈ 30.5 lp/mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a424-v12-03","title":"離軸全像記錄與載波頻率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Off-axis fringes and the sensor” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"對一張空白區域全像圖做二維傅立葉轉換，量 +1 階中心到零階的距離並換算成 lp/mm，與 λ·sinθ 的設計值比較；再檢查 +1 階與零階邊緣之間是否留有空隙，並確認 +1 階完全落在奈奎斯特邊界內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take the 2D Fourier transform of a hologram of an empty field, measure the distance from the +1 order centre to the zero order in lp/mm and compare with the design value sinθ/λ; then check that a gap remains between the +1 order and the edge of the zero-order lobe and that the +1 order lies entirely inside the Nyquist boundary. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：參考光角度太小時 +1 階與零階重疊，重建相位出現低頻假象與對比損失；角度太大時條紋欠取樣而混疊，相位圖出現與樣品無關的摩爾紋。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Too small a reference angle overlaps the +1 and zero orders, producing low-frequency artefacts and contrast loss in the reconstructed phase; too large an angle undersamples the fringes and aliasing imprints moiré patterns unrelated to the sample.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對一張空白區域全像圖做二維傅立葉轉換，量 +1 階中心到零階的距離並換算成 lp/mm，與 λ·sinθ 的設計值比較；再檢查 +1 階與零階邊緣之間是否留有空隙，並確認 +1 階完全落在奈奎斯特邊界內。","textEn":"Take the 2D Fourier transform of a hologram of an empty field, measure the distance from the +1 order centre to the zero order in lp/mm and compare with the design value sinθ/λ; then check that a gap remains between the +1 order and the edge of the zero-order lobe and that the +1 order lies entirely inside the Nyquist boundary.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「離軸全像記錄與載波頻率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency\"?","options":["對一張空白區域全像圖做二維傅立葉轉換，量 +1 階中心到零階的距離並換算成 lp/mm，與 λ·sinθ 的設計值比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。"],"optionsEn":["Take the 2D Fourier transform of a hologram of an empty field, measure the distance from the +1 order centre to the zero order in lp/mm and compare with the design value sinθ/λ.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective."],"answer":0,"explanation":"對一張空白區域全像圖做二維傅立葉轉換，量 +1 階中心到零階的距離並換算成 lp/mm，與 λ·sinθ 的設計值比較；再檢查 +1 階與零階邊緣之間是否留有空隙，並確認 +1 階完全落在奈奎斯特邊界內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take the 2D Fourier transform of a hologram of an empty field, measure the distance from the +1 order centre to the zero order in lp/mm and compare with the design value sinθ/λ; then check that a gap remains between the +1 order and the edge of the zero-order lobe and that the +1 order lies entirely inside the Nyquist boundary. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a424-v12-04","title":"離軸全像記錄與載波頻率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「離軸干涉條紋與感測器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Off-axis fringes and the sensor” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"參考光角度太小時 +1 階與零階重疊，重建相位出現低頻假象與對比損失；角度太大時條紋欠取樣而混疊，相位圖出現與樣品無關的摩爾紋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Too small a reference angle overlaps the +1 and zero orders, producing low-frequency artefacts and contrast loss in the reconstructed phase; too large an angle undersamples the fringes and aliasing imprints moiré patterns unrelated to the sample. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：載波必須夠高才能分離三項，卻又不能高到讓條紋週期小於兩個像素而違反取樣定理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The carrier must be high enough to separate the three terms yet low enough that the fringe period stays above two pixels, otherwise sampling fails.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"參考光角度太小時 +1 階與零階重疊，重建相位出現低頻假象與對比損失；角度太大時條紋欠取樣而混疊，相位圖出現與樣品無關的摩爾紋。","textEn":"Too small a reference angle overlaps the +1 and zero orders, producing low-frequency artefacts and contrast loss in the reconstructed phase; too large an angle undersamples the fringes and aliasing imprints moiré patterns unrelated to the sample.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「離軸全像記錄與載波頻率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Off-axis hologram recording and carrier frequency\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","參考光角度太小時 +1 階與零階重疊，重建相位出現低頻假象與對比損失；角度太大時條紋欠取樣而混疊，相位圖出現與樣品無關的摩爾紋。","只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Too small a reference angle overlaps the +1 and zero orders, producing low-frequency artefacts and contrast loss in the reconstructed phase.","If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity."],"answer":1,"explanation":"參考光角度太小時 +1 階與零階重疊，重建相位出現低頻假象與對比損失；角度太大時條紋欠取樣而混疊，相位圖出現與樣品無關的摩爾紋。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Too small a reference angle overlaps the +1 and zero orders, producing low-frequency artefacts and contrast loss in the reconstructed phase; too large an angle undersamples the fringes and aliasing imprints moiré patterns unrelated to the sample. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a424-v12-05","title":"相位與光程差、包裹與展開：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「包裹相位圖」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Wrapped phase map” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"重建得到的相位 φ = arg(O) 只在 (−π, π] 內有定義，實際光程差超過一個波長時相位會跳回，形成 2π 包裹。透射量測的相位 Δφ = 2π·(n_s − n_m)·h/λ 與樣品厚度 h 及折射率差成正比；反射量測因光來回兩次，Δφ = 4π·h/λ。展開演算法沿路徑補回 2π 跳變，但只在相鄰像素相位差小於 π 時可靠，陡峭台階需要雙波長合成波長來擴大不含糊範圍。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「包裹相位圖」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The reconstructed phase φ = arg(O) is defined only within (−π, π]; when the real optical path exceeds one wavelength the phase jumps back, producing 2π wraps. In transmission Δφ = 2π·(n_s − n_m)·h/λ scales with sample thickness h and the index difference; in reflection the light travels twice, so Δφ = 4π·h/λ. Unwrapping algorithms restore the 2π jumps along a path, but only reliably when neighbouring pixels differ by less than π, so steep steps need a two-wavelength synthetic wavelength to extend the unambiguous range. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Wrapped phase map”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：反射式在 λ = 532 nm 的不含糊高度範圍為 λ/2 = 266 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: In reflection at λ = 532 nm the unambiguous height range is λ/2 = 266 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「包裹相位圖」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Wrapped phase map”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-05-k1","title":"相位與光程差、包裹與展開","titleEn":"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping","text":"重建得到的相位 φ = arg(O) 只在 (−π, π] 內有定義，實際光程差超過一個波長時相位會跳回，形成 2π 包裹。透射量測的相位 Δφ = 2π·(n_s − n_m)·h/λ 與樣品厚度 h 及折射率差成正比；反射量測因光來回兩次，Δφ = 4π·h/λ。","textEn":"The reconstructed phase φ = arg(O) is defined only within (−π, π]; when the real optical path exceeds one wavelength the phase jumps back, producing 2π wraps. In transmission Δφ = 2π·(n_s − n_m)·h/λ scales with sample thickness h and the index difference; in reflection the light travels twice, so Δφ = 4π·h/λ.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「相位與光程差、包裹與展開」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping\" is correct?","options":["只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。","重建得到的相位 φ = arg(O) 只在 (−π, π] 內有定義，實際光程差超過一個波長時相位會跳回，形成 2π 包裹。"],"optionsEn":["If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.","The reconstructed phase φ = arg(O) is defined only within (−π, π]; when the real optical path exceeds one wavelength the phase jumps back, producing 2π wraps."],"answer":2,"explanation":"重建得到的相位 φ = arg(O) 只在 (−π, π] 內有定義，實際光程差超過一個波長時相位會跳回，形成 2π 包裹。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The reconstructed phase φ = arg(O) is defined only within (−π, π]; when the real optical path exceeds one wavelength the phase jumps back, producing 2π wraps. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a424-v12-06","title":"相位與光程差、包裹與展開：定量估算","titleEn":"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「包裹相位圖」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Wrapped phase map” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：反射式在 λ = 532 nm 的不含糊高度範圍為 λ/2 = 266 nm。一個 400 nm 台階給出 Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad，包裹後讀到 9.45 − 4π = −3.12 rad，若不展開會誤判為 −132 nm。改用 532 與 561 nm 雙波長，合成波長 Λ = λ₁λ₂/|λ₁ − λ₂| = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm，範圍擴大到 Λ/2 ≈ 5.1 µm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: In reflection at λ = 532 nm the unambiguous height range is λ/2 = 266 nm. A 400 nm step gives Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad, which wraps to 9.45 − 4π = −3.12 rad and would be misread as −132 nm without unwrapping. With 532 and 561 nm the synthetic wavelength Λ = λ₁λ₂/|λ₁ − λ₂| = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm extends the range to Λ/2 ≈ 5.1 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量測一片已認證的台階高度標準片，比較展開後的台階高度與證書值；再刻意量一個超過 λ/2 的台階，確認單波長結果出現 2π 錯誤而雙波長結果正確，並記錄展開演算法在雜訊區的失敗率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure a certified step-height standard and compare the unwrapped step with the certificate; then deliberately measure a step higher than λ/2 to confirm that the single-wavelength result carries a 2π error while the two-wavelength result is correct, and log where the unwrapping algorithm fails in noisy regions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"反射式在 λ = 532 nm 的不含糊高度範圍為 λ/2 = 266 nm。一個 400 nm 台階給出 Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad，包裹後讀到 9.45 − 4π = −3.12 rad，若不展開會誤判為 −132 nm。改用 532 與 561 nm 雙波長，合成波長 Λ = λ₁λ₂/|λ₁ − λ₂| = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm，範圍擴大到 Λ/2 ≈ 5.1 µm。","textEn":"In reflection at λ = 532 nm the unambiguous height range is λ/2 = 266 nm. A 400 nm step gives Δφ = 4π×0.400/0.532 = 9.45 rad, which wraps to 9.45 − 4π = −3.12 rad and would be misread as −132 nm without unwrapping. With 532 and 561 nm the synthetic wavelength Λ = λ₁λ₂/|λ₁ − λ₂| = 532×561/29 ≈ 10.29 µm extends the range to Λ/2 ≈ 5.1 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「相位與光程差、包裹與展開」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping\", which statement holds?","options":["反射式在 λ = 532 nm 的不含糊高度範圍為 λ/2 = 266 nm。","定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。","數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。"],"optionsEn":["In reflection at λ = 532 nm the unambiguous height range is λ/2 = 266 nm.","Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index.","Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective."],"answer":0,"explanation":"反射式在 λ = 532 nm 的不含糊高度範圍為 λ/2 = 266 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"In reflection at λ = 532 nm the unambiguous height range is λ/2 = 266 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a424-v12-07","title":"相位與光程差、包裹與展開：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「包裹相位圖」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Wrapped phase map” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量測一片已認證的台階高度標準片，比較展開後的台階高度與證書值；再刻意量一個超過 λ/2 的台階，確認單波長結果出現 2π 錯誤而雙波長結果正確，並記錄展開演算法在雜訊區的失敗率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure a certified step-height standard and compare the unwrapped step with the certificate; then deliberately measure a step higher than λ/2 to confirm that the single-wavelength result carries a 2π error while the two-wavelength result is correct, and log where the unwrapping algorithm fails in noisy regions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：展開路徑穿過低對比或散斑區時，一個錯誤的 2π 判定會沿路徑傳播，整個區域的高度整體偏移半個波長，造成看似合理卻完全錯誤的地形圖。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When the unwrapping path crosses a low-contrast or speckled region, one wrong 2π decision propagates along the path and offsets a whole region by half a wavelength, producing a plausible but entirely wrong topography.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測一片已認證的台階高度標準片，比較展開後的台階高度與證書值；再刻意量一個超過 λ/2 的台階，確認單波長結果出現 2π 錯誤而雙波長結果正確，並記錄展開演算法在雜訊區的失敗率。","textEn":"Measure a certified step-height standard and compare the unwrapped step with the certificate; then deliberately measure a step higher than λ/2 to confirm that the single-wavelength result carries a 2π error while the two-wavelength result is correct, and log where the unwrapping algorithm fails in noisy regions.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「相位與光程差、包裹與展開」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","量測一片已認證的台階高度標準片，比較展開後的台階高度與證書值。","台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure a certified step-height standard and compare the unwrapped step with the certificate.","One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測一片已認證的台階高度標準片，比較展開後的台階高度與證書值；再刻意量一個超過 λ/2 的台階，確認單波長結果出現 2π 錯誤而雙波長結果正確，並記錄展開演算法在雜訊區的失敗率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure a certified step-height standard and compare the unwrapped step with the certificate; then deliberately measure a step higher than λ/2 to confirm that the single-wavelength result carries a 2π error while the two-wavelength result is correct, and log where the unwrapping algorithm fails in noisy regions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a424-v12-08","title":"相位與光程差、包裹與展開：失效診斷","titleEn":"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「包裹相位圖」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Wrapped phase map” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"展開路徑穿過低對比或散斑區時，一個錯誤的 2π 判定會沿路徑傳播，整個區域的高度整體偏移半個波長，造成看似合理卻完全錯誤的地形圖。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When the unwrapping path crosses a low-contrast or speckled region, one wrong 2π decision propagates along the path and offsets a whole region by half a wavelength, producing a plausible but entirely wrong topography. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：展開演算法沿路徑補回 2π 跳變，但只在相鄰像素相位差小於 π 時可靠，陡峭台階需要雙波長合成波長來擴大不含糊範圍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Unwrapping algorithms restore the 2π jumps along a path, but only reliably when neighbouring pixels differ by less than π, so steep steps need a two-wavelength synthetic wavelength to extend the unambiguous range.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"展開路徑穿過低對比或散斑區時，一個錯誤的 2π 判定會沿路徑傳播，整個區域的高度整體偏移半個波長，造成看似合理卻完全錯誤的地形圖。","textEn":"When the unwrapping path crosses a low-contrast or speckled region, one wrong 2π decision propagates along the path and offsets a whole region by half a wavelength, producing a plausible but entirely wrong topography.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「相位與光程差、包裹與展開」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Phase, optical path difference, wrapping and unwrapping\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。","展開路徑穿過低對比或散斑區時，一個錯誤的 2π 判定會沿路徑傳播，整個區域的高度整體偏移半個波長，造成看似合理卻完全錯誤的地形圖。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.","When the unwrapping path crosses a low-contrast or speckled region, one wrong 2π decision propagates along the path and offsets a whole region by half a wavelength, producing a plausible but entirely wrong topography."],"answer":2,"explanation":"展開路徑穿過低對比或散斑區時，一個錯誤的 2π 判定會沿路徑傳播，整個區域的高度整體偏移半個波長，造成看似合理卻完全錯誤的地形圖。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When the unwrapping path crosses a low-contrast or speckled region, one wrong 2π decision propagates along the path and offsets a whole region by half a wavelength, producing a plausible but entirely wrong topography. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a424-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配」與「物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching\" and \"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a424-v12-09","title":"光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「雷射光源與參考臂」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Laser source and reference arm” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"干涉條紋的對比取決於兩臂光程差與光源同調長度的關係，以及兩光束的強度比。長同調雷射讓裝調容易，但光學元件的寄生反射也會互相干涉，形成固定的同調雜訊；短同調光源能壓制這些雜訊，代價是兩臂光程必須匹配到同調長度的一小部分，並且樣品厚度變化也會讓對比下降。參考臂通常用可調延遲線與衰減器，把強度比與光程都調到設計點。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「雷射光源與參考臂」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fringe contrast depends on the arm path difference relative to the source coherence length and on the intensity ratio of the two beams. A long-coherence laser makes alignment easy but lets parasitic reflections from every optic interfere as fixed coherent noise; a short-coherence source suppresses that noise at the price of matching the two arm paths to a fraction of the coherence length, and thick samples also reduce contrast. The reference arm therefore carries an adjustable delay line and an attenuator to set both the path and the intensity ratio at the design point. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Laser source and reference arm”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：同調長度 L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ：660 nm 雷射二極體、Δλ = 0.05 nm 時 L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Coherence length L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ: a 660 nm laser diode with Δλ = 0.05 nm has L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「雷射光源與參考臂」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Laser source and reference arm”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-09-k1","title":"光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配","titleEn":"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching","text":"干涉條紋的對比取決於兩臂光程差與光源同調長度的關係，以及兩光束的強度比。長同調雷射讓裝調容易，但光學元件的寄生反射也會互相干涉，形成固定的同調雜訊；短同調光源能壓制這些雜訊，代價是兩臂光程必須匹配到同調長度的一小部分，並且樣品厚度變化也會讓對比下降。","textEn":"Fringe contrast depends on the arm path difference relative to the source coherence length and on the intensity ratio of the two beams. A long-coherence laser makes alignment easy but lets parasitic reflections from every optic interfere as fixed coherent noise; a short-coherence source suppresses that noise at the price of matching the two arm paths to a fraction of the coherence length, and thick samples also reduce contrast.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching\" is correct?","options":["干涉條紋的對比取決於兩臂光程差與光源同調長度的關係，以及兩光束的強度比。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。","數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Fringe contrast depends on the arm path difference relative to the source coherence length and on the intensity ratio of the two beams.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.","Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"干涉條紋的對比取決於兩臂光程差與光源同調長度的關係，以及兩光束的強度比。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fringe contrast depends on the arm path difference relative to the source coherence length and on the intensity ratio of the two beams. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a424-v12-10","title":"光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配：定量估算","titleEn":"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雷射光源與參考臂」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Laser source and reference arm” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：同調長度 L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ：660 nm 雷射二極體、Δλ = 0.05 nm 時 L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm。條紋對比 V = 2√(I_O·I_R)/(I_O + I_R)·|γ|；取 I_R = 4·I_O 得幾何因子 0.8，若線形為勞侖茲型 |γ| ≈ exp(−ΔL/L_c)，ΔL = 2 mm 時 |γ| ≈ 0.79，V ≈ 0.63。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Coherence length L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ: a 660 nm laser diode with Δλ = 0.05 nm has L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm. Fringe contrast is V = 2√(I_O·I_R)/(I_O + I_R)·|γ|; with I_R = 4·I_O the geometric factor is 0.8, and for a Lorentzian line |γ| ≈ exp(−ΔL/L_c), so ΔL = 2 mm gives |γ| ≈ 0.79 and V ≈ 0.63. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以功率計分別量兩臂到達感測器的強度並算出幾何因子，再掃描參考臂延遲線、記錄條紋對比對光程差的曲線，從曲線半寬反推同調長度並與光譜儀量到的線寬比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure each arm's intensity at the sensor with a power meter and compute the geometric factor, then scan the reference delay line while recording fringe contrast against path difference; derive the coherence length from the curve width and compare with the linewidth measured on a spectrometer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"同調長度 L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ：660 nm 雷射二極體、Δλ = 0.05 nm 時 L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm。條紋對比 V = 2√(I_O·I_R)/(I_O + I_R)·|γ|；取 I_R = 4·I_O 得幾何因子 0.8，若線形為勞侖茲型 |γ| ≈ exp(−ΔL/L_c)，ΔL = 2 mm 時 |γ| ≈ 0.79，V ≈ 0.63。","textEn":"Coherence length L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ: a 660 nm laser diode with Δλ = 0.05 nm has L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm. Fringe contrast is V = 2√(I_O·I_R)/(I_O + I_R)·|γ|; with I_R = 4·I_O the geometric factor is 0.8, and for a Lorentzian line |γ| ≈ exp(−ΔL/L_c), so ΔL = 2 mm gives |γ| ≈ 0.79 and V ≈ 0.63.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching\", which statement holds?","options":["相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。","同調長度 L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ：660 nm 雷射二極體、Δλ = 0.05 nm 時 L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm。","台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.","Coherence length L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ: a 660 nm laser diode with Δλ = 0.05 nm has L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm.","One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同調長度 L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ：660 nm 雷射二極體、Δλ = 0.05 nm 時 L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Coherence length L_c ≈ λ²/Δλ: a 660 nm laser diode with Δλ = 0.05 nm has L_c ≈ 0.660²/5×10⁻⁵ µm ≈ 8.7 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a424-v12-11","title":"光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「雷射光源與參考臂」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Laser source and reference arm” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以功率計分別量兩臂到達感測器的強度並算出幾何因子，再掃描參考臂延遲線、記錄條紋對比對光程差的曲線，從曲線半寬反推同調長度並與光譜儀量到的線寬比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure each arm's intensity at the sensor with a power meter and compute the geometric factor, then scan the reference delay line while recording fringe contrast against path difference; derive the coherence length from the curve width and compare with the linewidth measured on a spectrometer. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：參考臂光程偏離匹配點數毫米時，條紋對比降到 0.3 以下，相位雜訊按 1/V 放大，而且樣品厚區與薄區對比不同，造成高度量測在視場內不一致。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When the reference path drifts several millimetres from the match point, fringe contrast falls below 0.3, phase noise grows as 1/V, and thick and thin sample regions show different contrast, making height measurements inconsistent across the field.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以功率計分別量兩臂到達感測器的強度並算出幾何因子，再掃描參考臂延遲線、記錄條紋對比對光程差的曲線，從曲線半寬反推同調長度並與光譜儀量到的線寬比較。","textEn":"Measure each arm's intensity at the sensor with a power meter and compute the geometric factor, then scan the reference delay line while recording fringe contrast against path difference; derive the coherence length from the curve width and compare with the linewidth measured on a spectrometer.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","以功率計分別量兩臂到達感測器的強度並算出幾何因子，再掃描參考臂延遲線、記錄條紋對比對光程差的曲線，從曲線半寬反推同調長度並與光譜儀量到的線寬比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","Measure each arm's intensity at the sensor with a power meter and compute the geometric factor, then scan the reference delay line while recording fringe contrast against path difference."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以功率計分別量兩臂到達感測器的強度並算出幾何因子，再掃描參考臂延遲線、記錄條紋對比對光程差的曲線，從曲線半寬反推同調長度並與光譜儀量到的線寬比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure each arm's intensity at the sensor with a power meter and compute the geometric factor, then scan the reference delay line while recording fringe contrast against path difference; derive the coherence length from the curve width and compare with the linewidth measured on a spectrometer. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a424-v12-12","title":"光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配：失效診斷","titleEn":"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雷射光源與參考臂」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Laser source and reference arm” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"參考臂光程偏離匹配點數毫米時，條紋對比降到 0.3 以下，相位雜訊按 1/V 放大，而且樣品厚區與薄區對比不同，造成高度量測在視場內不一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When the reference path drifts several millimetres from the match point, fringe contrast falls below 0.3, phase noise grows as 1/V, and thick and thin sample regions show different contrast, making height measurements inconsistent across the field. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：參考臂通常用可調延遲線與衰減器，把強度比與光程都調到設計點。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The reference arm therefore carries an adjustable delay line and an attenuator to set both the path and the intensity ratio at the design point.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"參考臂光程偏離匹配點數毫米時，條紋對比降到 0.3 以下，相位雜訊按 1/V 放大，而且樣品厚區與薄區對比不同，造成高度量測在視場內不一致。","textEn":"When the reference path drifts several millimetres from the match point, fringe contrast falls below 0.3, phase noise grows as 1/V, and thick and thin sample regions show different contrast, making height measurements inconsistent across the field.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光源同調與參考臂的路徑匹配」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Source coherence and reference-arm path matching\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["參考臂光程偏離匹配點數毫米時，條紋對比降到 0.3 以下，相位雜訊按 1/V 放大，而且樣品厚區與薄區對比不同，造成高度量測在視場內不一致。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。"],"optionsEn":["When the reference path drifts several millimetres from the match point, fringe contrast falls below 0.3, phase noise grows as 1/V, and thick and thin sample regions show different contrast, making height measurements inconsistent across the field.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"參考臂光程偏離匹配點數毫米時，條紋對比降到 0.3 以下，相位雜訊按 1/V 放大，而且樣品厚區與薄區對比不同，造成高度量測在視場內不一致。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When the reference path drifts several millimetres from the match point, fringe contrast falls below 0.3, phase noise grows as 1/V, and thick and thin sample regions show different contrast, making height measurements inconsistent across the field. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a424-v12-13","title":"物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Microscope objective and curvature compensation” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"顯微物鏡把物光放大並投射到感測器，但也在物光上疊加一個球面相位，與平面參考光相減後留下二次項曲率，必須以參考臂放置相同物鏡做物理補償，或在重建時乘上數位相位遮罩做數值補償。感測器的像素尺寸、位元深度與滿井電荷決定條紋取樣與相位雜訊；同調照明下的橫向解析極限為 λ/NA，放大率需讓這個尺度在感測器上占數個像素。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The objective magnifies the object wave onto the sensor but also imposes a spherical phase on it; subtracting the plane reference leaves a quadratic curvature that must be compensated physically with an identical objective in the reference arm or numerically with a digital phase mask at reconstruction. Pixel pitch, bit depth and full-well capacity of the sensor set fringe sampling and phase noise; under coherent illumination the lateral resolution limit is λ/NA, and the magnification must map that scale onto several pixels. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Microscope objective and curvature compensation”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：殘留曲率半徑 R 造成的二次相位 φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R)：感測器上 r = 1 mm（約 290 像素）、R = 2 m、λ = 532 nm 時 φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad，即使 2 m 的殘留曲率在視場邊緣也接近一個波長。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A residual curvature radius R leaves a quadratic phase φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R): at r = 1 mm on the sensor (about 290 pixels), R = 2 m and λ = 532 nm, φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad, so even a 2 m residual radius approaches one wave at the field edge.","failure":"常見誤解：「數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Microscope objective and curvature compensation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-13-k1","title":"物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣","titleEn":"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling","text":"顯微物鏡把物光放大並投射到感測器，但也在物光上疊加一個球面相位，與平面參考光相減後留下二次項曲率，必須以參考臂放置相同物鏡做物理補償，或在重建時乘上數位相位遮罩做數值補償。感測器的像素尺寸、位元深度與滿井電荷決定條紋取樣與相位雜訊；同調照明下的橫向解析極限為 λ/NA，放大率需讓這個尺度在感測器上占數個像素。","textEn":"The objective magnifies the object wave onto the sensor but also imposes a spherical phase on it; subtracting the plane reference leaves a quadratic curvature that must be compensated physically with an identical objective in the reference arm or numerically with a digital phase mask at reconstruction. Pixel pitch, bit depth and full-well capacity of the sensor set fringe sampling and phase noise; under coherent illumination the lateral resolution limit is λ/NA, and the magnification must map that scale onto several pixels.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling\" is correct?","options":["數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。","顯微物鏡把物光放大並投射到感測器，但也在物光上疊加一個球面相位，與平面參考光相減後留下二次項曲率，必須以參考臂放置相同物鏡做物理補償，或在重建時乘上數位相位遮罩做數值補償。","定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。"],"optionsEn":["Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.","The objective magnifies the object wave onto the sensor but also imposes a spherical phase on it.","Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index."],"answer":1,"explanation":"顯微物鏡把物光放大並投射到感測器，但也在物光上疊加一個球面相位，與平面參考光相減後留下二次項曲率，必須以參考臂放置相同物鏡做物理補償，或在重建時乘上數位相位遮罩做數值補償。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The objective magnifies the object wave onto the sensor but also imposes a spherical phase on it; subtracting the plane reference leaves a quadratic curvature that must be compensated physically with an identical objective in the reference arm or numerically with a digital phase mask at reconstruction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a424-v12-14","title":"物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣：定量估算","titleEn":"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Microscope objective and curvature compensation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：殘留曲率半徑 R 造成的二次相位 φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R)：感測器上 r = 1 mm（約 290 像素）、R = 2 m、λ = 532 nm 時 φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad，即使 2 m 的殘留曲率在視場邊緣也接近一個波長。40×/0.65 物鏡的同調解析極限 λ/NA ≈ 0.82 µm，在感測器上為 32.7 µm ≈ 9.5 個 3.45 µm 像素。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A residual curvature radius R leaves a quadratic phase φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R): at r = 1 mm on the sensor (about 290 pixels), R = 2 m and λ = 532 nm, φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad, so even a 2 m residual radius approaches one wave at the field edge. The coherent resolution limit of a 40×/0.65 objective is λ/NA ≈ 0.82 µm, which maps to 32.7 µm or about 9.5 pixels of 3.45 µm on the sensor. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：重建一片光學平板的相位圖，對其擬合二次多項式取出殘留曲率半徑，調整補償物鏡位置或數位遮罩參數直到殘留峰谷值小於 0.1 rad；再用解析力標板確認橫向解析度達到 λ/NA 的設計值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Reconstruct the phase of an optical flat, fit a quadratic polynomial to extract the residual curvature radius, and adjust the compensating objective or the digital mask until the residual peak-to-valley is below 0.1 rad; then confirm with a resolution target that the lateral resolution reaches the λ/NA design value.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"殘留曲率半徑 R 造成的二次相位 φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R)：感測器上 r = 1 mm（約 290 像素）、R = 2 m、λ = 532 nm 時 φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad，即使 2 m 的殘留曲率在視場邊緣也接近一個波長。40×/0.65 物鏡的同調解析極限 λ/NA ≈ 0.82 µm，在感測器上為 32.7 µm ≈ 9.5 個 3.45 µm 像素。","textEn":"A residual curvature radius R leaves a quadratic phase φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R): at r = 1 mm on the sensor (about 290 pixels), R = 2 m and λ = 532 nm, φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad, so even a 2 m residual radius approaches one wave at the field edge. The coherent resolution limit of a 40×/0.65 objective is λ/NA ≈ 0.82 µm, which maps to 32.7 µm or about 9.5 pixels of 3.45 µm on the sensor.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling\", which statement holds?","options":["數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。","載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","殘留曲率半徑 R 造成的二次相位 φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R)：感測器上 r = 1 mm（約 290 像素）、R = 2 m、λ = 532 nm 時 φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad，即使 2 m 的殘留曲率在視場邊緣也接近一個波長。"],"optionsEn":["Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective.","A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","A residual curvature radius R leaves a quadratic phase φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R): at r = 1 mm on the sensor (about 290 pixels), R = 2 m and λ = 532 nm, φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad, so even a 2 m residual radius approaches one wave at the field edge."],"answer":2,"explanation":"殘留曲率半徑 R 造成的二次相位 φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R)：感測器上 r = 1 mm（約 290 像素）、R = 2 m、λ = 532 nm 時 φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad，即使 2 m 的殘留曲率在視場邊緣也接近一個波長。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A residual curvature radius R leaves a quadratic phase φ(r) = π·r²/(λ·R): at r = 1 mm on the sensor (about 290 pixels), R = 2 m and λ = 532 nm, φ ≈ π×10⁻⁶/(0.532×10⁻⁶×2) ≈ 2.95 rad, so even a 2 m residual radius approaches one wave at the field edge. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a424-v12-15","title":"物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Microscope objective and curvature compensation” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"重建一片光學平板的相位圖，對其擬合二次多項式取出殘留曲率半徑，調整補償物鏡位置或數位遮罩參數直到殘留峰谷值小於 0.1 rad；再用解析力標板確認橫向解析度達到 λ/NA 的設計值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Reconstruct the phase of an optical flat, fit a quadratic polynomial to extract the residual curvature radius, and adjust the compensating objective or the digital mask until the residual peak-to-valley is below 0.1 rad; then confirm with a resolution target that the lateral resolution reaches the λ/NA design value. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若用平坦區擬合去除曲率時把樣品本身的大尺度形貌一起扣掉，平緩的真實曲面會從量測結果中消失，得到假的平坦表面。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the curvature fit on a flat region also removes the sample's own large-scale shape, a gently curved real surface disappears from the measurement and a false flat surface results.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"重建一片光學平板的相位圖，對其擬合二次多項式取出殘留曲率半徑，調整補償物鏡位置或數位遮罩參數直到殘留峰谷值小於 0.1 rad；再用解析力標板確認橫向解析度達到 λ/NA 的設計值。","textEn":"Reconstruct the phase of an optical flat, fit a quadratic polynomial to extract the residual curvature radius, and adjust the compensating objective or the digital mask until the residual peak-to-valley is below 0.1 rad; then confirm with a resolution target that the lateral resolution reaches the λ/NA design value.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling\"?","options":["重建一片光學平板的相位圖，對其擬合二次多項式取出殘留曲率半徑，調整補償物鏡位置或數位遮罩參數直到殘留峰谷值小於 0.1 rad。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。"],"optionsEn":["Reconstruct the phase of an optical flat, fit a quadratic polynomial to extract the residual curvature radius, and adjust the compensating objective or the digital mask until the residual peak-to-valley is below 0.1 rad.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"重建一片光學平板的相位圖，對其擬合二次多項式取出殘留曲率半徑，調整補償物鏡位置或數位遮罩參數直到殘留峰谷值小於 0.1 rad；再用解析力標板確認橫向解析度達到 λ/NA 的設計值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Reconstruct the phase of an optical flat, fit a quadratic polynomial to extract the residual curvature radius, and adjust the compensating objective or the digital mask until the residual peak-to-valley is below 0.1 rad; then confirm with a resolution target that the lateral resolution reaches the λ/NA design value. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a424-v12-16","title":"物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣：失效診斷","titleEn":"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「顯微物鏡與曲率補償」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Microscope objective and curvature compensation” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若用平坦區擬合去除曲率時把樣品本身的大尺度形貌一起扣掉，平緩的真實曲面會從量測結果中消失，得到假的平坦表面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the curvature fit on a flat region also removes the sample's own large-scale shape, a gently curved real surface disappears from the measurement and a false flat surface results. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：感測器的像素尺寸、位元深度與滿井電荷決定條紋取樣與相位雜訊；同調照明下的橫向解析極限為 λ/NA，放大率需讓這個尺度在感測器上占數個像素。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pixel pitch, bit depth and full-well capacity of the sensor set fringe sampling and phase noise; under coherent illumination the lateral resolution limit is λ/NA, and the magnification must map that scale onto several pixels.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若用平坦區擬合去除曲率時把樣品本身的大尺度形貌一起扣掉，平緩的真實曲面會從量測結果中消失，得到假的平坦表面。","textEn":"If the curvature fit on a flat region also removes the sample's own large-scale shape, a gently curved real surface disappears from the measurement and a false flat surface results.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「物鏡、中繼光學與感測器取樣」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Objective, relay optics and sensor sampling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若用平坦區擬合去除曲率時把樣品本身的大尺度形貌一起扣掉，平緩的真實曲面會從量測結果中消失，得到假的平坦表面。","定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If the curvature fit on a flat region also removes the sample's own large-scale shape, a gently curved real surface disappears from the measurement and a false flat surface results.","Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若用平坦區擬合去除曲率時把樣品本身的大尺度形貌一起扣掉，平緩的真實曲面會從量測結果中消失，得到假的平坦表面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the curvature fit on a flat region also removes the sample's own large-scale shape, a gently curved real surface disappears from the measurement and a false flat surface results. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a424-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「高度校正、波長與折射率追溯」與「相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability\" and \"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a424-v12-17","title":"高度校正、波長與折射率追溯：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「台階標準片與折射率解耦」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Step standard and index decoupling” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"相位轉換成高度需要準確的波長與折射率差。反射式只依賴波長與入射角，可以用認證台階標準片直接驗證；透射式的厚度與折射率差耦合在同一個光程差裡，必須用兩種已知折射率的介質分別量測來解耦，或用已知厚度的樣品反推折射率。橫向比例尺則以載物台測微尺或光柵標板校正，和高度軸分開追溯。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「台階標準片與折射率解耦」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Converting phase to height needs an accurate wavelength and index difference. Reflection measurements depend only on wavelength and incidence angle and can be checked directly with a certified step standard; in transmission, thickness and index difference are coupled in one optical path difference, so they are decoupled by measuring in two media of known index or by inferring index from a sample of known thickness. The lateral scale is calibrated separately with a stage micrometer or grating target. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Step standard and index decoupling”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：透射式的相對誤差為 δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: In transmission the relative error is δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn.","failure":"常見誤解：「定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「台階標準片與折射率解耦」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Step standard and index decoupling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-17-k1","title":"高度校正、波長與折射率追溯","titleEn":"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability","text":"相位轉換成高度需要準確的波長與折射率差。反射式只依賴波長與入射角，可以用認證台階標準片直接驗證；透射式的厚度與折射率差耦合在同一個光程差裡，必須用兩種已知折射率的介質分別量測來解耦，或用已知厚度的樣品反推折射率。","textEn":"Converting phase to height needs an accurate wavelength and index difference. Reflection measurements depend only on wavelength and incidence angle and can be checked directly with a certified step standard; in transmission, thickness and index difference are coupled in one optical path difference, so they are decoupled by measuring in two media of known index or by inferring index from a sample of known thickness.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「高度校正、波長與折射率追溯」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability\" is correct?","options":["定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。","相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。","相位轉換成高度需要準確的波長與折射率差。"],"optionsEn":["Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index.","Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.","Converting phase to height needs an accurate wavelength and index difference."],"answer":2,"explanation":"相位轉換成高度需要準確的波長與折射率差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Converting phase to height needs an accurate wavelength and index difference. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a424-v12-18","title":"高度校正、波長與折射率追溯：定量估算","titleEn":"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「台階標準片與折射率解耦」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Step standard and index decoupling” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：透射式的相對誤差為 δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn。Δn = 0.035 ± 0.002 時折射率項為 5.7%，而 λ = 532 ± 0.1 nm 的波長項只有 0.02%。量到 OPD = 280 nm 時，Δn = 0.035 給 h = 8.00 µm，Δn = 0.037 則給 7.57 µm，差 5.4%，顯示折射率才是主要誤差來源。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: In transmission the relative error is δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn. With Δn = 0.035 ± 0.002 the index term is 5.7%, whereas λ = 532 ± 0.1 nm contributes only 0.02%. For a measured OPD = 280 nm, Δn = 0.035 gives h = 8.00 µm but Δn = 0.037 gives 7.57 µm, a 5.4% difference, so the refractive index dominates the error. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以反射模式量測認證台階片（例如 100 nm 等級）取得高度軸比例；透射模式下把同一細胞或微結構分別浸在兩種已知折射率介質中量測 OPD，聯立解出厚度與折射率，並與原子力顯微鏡或輪廓儀的厚度比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the height axis in reflection with a certified step of order 100 nm; in transmission measure the OPD of the same cell or microstructure immersed in two media of known index, solve the pair of equations for thickness and index, and compare the thickness with an atomic-force microscope or profilometer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"透射式的相對誤差為 δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn。Δn = 0.035 ± 0.002 時折射率項為 5.7%，而 λ = 532 ± 0.1 nm 的波長項只有 0.02%。量到 OPD = 280 nm 時，Δn = 0.035 給 h = 8.00 µm，Δn = 0.037 則給 7.57 µm，差 5.4%，顯示折射率才是主要誤差來源。","textEn":"In transmission the relative error is δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn. With Δn = 0.035 ± 0.002 the index term is 5.7%, whereas λ = 532 ± 0.1 nm contributes only 0.02%. For a measured OPD = 280 nm, Δn = 0.035 gives h = 8.00 µm but Δn = 0.037 gives 7.57 µm, a 5.4% difference, so the refractive index dominates the error.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「高度校正、波長與折射率追溯」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability\", which statement holds?","options":["透射式的相對誤差為 δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn。","台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。","只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。"],"optionsEn":["In transmission the relative error is δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn.","One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted.","If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"透射式的相對誤差為 δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"In transmission the relative error is δh/h ≈ δλ/λ + δ(Δn)/Δn. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a424-v12-19","title":"高度校正、波長與折射率追溯：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「台階標準片與折射率解耦」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Step standard and index decoupling” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以反射模式量測認證台階片（例如 100 nm 等級）取得高度軸比例；透射模式下把同一細胞或微結構分別浸在兩種已知折射率介質中量測 OPD，聯立解出厚度與折射率，並與原子力顯微鏡或輪廓儀的厚度比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the height axis in reflection with a certified step of order 100 nm; in transmission measure the OPD of the same cell or microstructure immersed in two media of known index, solve the pair of equations for thickness and index, and compare the thickness with an atomic-force microscope or profilometer. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把文獻的平均細胞折射率套用到所有樣品，厚度誤差可達 5% 到 10%，且不同細胞類型之間的差異會被誤讀為厚度差異。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Applying a literature-average cell index to every sample produces thickness errors of 5% to 10%, and differences between cell types are misread as thickness differences.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以反射模式量測認證台階片（例如 100 nm 等級）取得高度軸比例；透射模式下把同一細胞或微結構分別浸在兩種已知折射率介質中量測 OPD，聯立解出厚度與折射率，並與原子力顯微鏡或輪廓儀的厚度比較。","textEn":"Calibrate the height axis in reflection with a certified step of order 100 nm; in transmission measure the OPD of the same cell or microstructure immersed in two media of known index, solve the pair of equations for thickness and index, and compare the thickness with an atomic-force microscope or profilometer.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「高度校正、波長與折射率追溯」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以反射模式量測認證台階片（例如 100 nm 等級）取得高度軸比例。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Calibrate the height axis in reflection with a certified step of order 100 nm.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以反射模式量測認證台階片（例如 100 nm 等級）取得高度軸比例；透射模式下把同一細胞或微結構分別浸在兩種已知折射率介質中量測 OPD，聯立解出厚度與折射率，並與原子力顯微鏡或輪廓儀的厚度比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the height axis in reflection with a certified step of order 100 nm; in transmission measure the OPD of the same cell or microstructure immersed in two media of known index, solve the pair of equations for thickness and index, and compare the thickness with an atomic-force microscope or profilometer. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a424-v12-20","title":"高度校正、波長與折射率追溯：失效診斷","titleEn":"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「台階標準片與折射率解耦」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Step standard and index decoupling” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把文獻的平均細胞折射率套用到所有樣品，厚度誤差可達 5% 到 10%，且不同細胞類型之間的差異會被誤讀為厚度差異。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Applying a literature-average cell index to every sample produces thickness errors of 5% to 10%, and differences between cell types are misread as thickness differences. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：橫向比例尺則以載物台測微尺或光柵標板校正，和高度軸分開追溯。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The lateral scale is calibrated separately with a stage micrometer or grating target.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把文獻的平均細胞折射率套用到所有樣品，厚度誤差可達 5% 到 10%，且不同細胞類型之間的差異會被誤讀為厚度差異。","textEn":"Applying a literature-average cell index to every sample produces thickness errors of 5% to 10%, and differences between cell types are misread as thickness differences.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「高度校正、波長與折射率追溯」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Height calibration, wavelength and refractive-index traceability\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。","把文獻的平均細胞折射率套用到所有樣品，厚度誤差可達 5% 到 10%，且不同細胞類型之間的差異會被誤讀為厚度差異。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.","Applying a literature-average cell index to every sample produces thickness errors of 5% to 10%, and differences between cell types are misread as thickness differences."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把文獻的平均細胞折射率套用到所有樣品，厚度誤差可達 5% 到 10%，且不同細胞類型之間的差異會被誤讀為厚度差異。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying a literature-average cell index to every sample produces thickness errors of 5% to 10%, and differences between cell types are misread as thickness differences. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a424-v12-21","title":"相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"相位雜訊來自光子散粒雜訊、感測器讀出雜訊、同調雜訊（寄生干涉與散斑）、以及兩臂之間的機械振動與空氣擾動。散粒雜訊決定單張全像圖的極限，與條紋對比和每像素光電子數有關；振動與熱漂移主要造成整場的活塞項與傾斜項，可用視場內的參考平坦區自我參考去除；殘留的空間雜訊則來自同調雜訊與曲率擬合殘差，需分項列入預算。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Phase noise comes from photon shot noise, sensor read noise, coherent noise from parasitic interference and speckle, and mechanical vibration and air turbulence between the arms. Shot noise sets the single-hologram limit and depends on fringe contrast and photoelectrons per pixel; vibration and thermal drift mainly add piston and tilt across the field, which self-referencing to a flat region removes; the remaining spatial noise comes from coherent noise and curvature-fit residuals and must be budgeted item by item. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：散粒雜訊極限 σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e)：N_e = 20,000 e⁻、V = 0.6 時 σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad，反射式 σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm，100 像素平均後約 0.05 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Shot-noise limit σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e): with N_e = 20,000 e⁻ and V = 0.6, σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad, so in reflection σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm, or about 0.05 nm after averaging 100 pixels.","failure":"常見誤解：「相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-21-k1","title":"相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算","titleEn":"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget","text":"相位雜訊來自光子散粒雜訊、感測器讀出雜訊、同調雜訊（寄生干涉與散斑）、以及兩臂之間的機械振動與空氣擾動。散粒雜訊決定單張全像圖的極限，與條紋對比和每像素光電子數有關；振動與熱漂移主要造成整場的活塞項與傾斜項，可用視場內的參考平坦區自我參考去除；殘留的空間雜訊則來自同調雜訊與曲率擬合殘差，需分項列入預算。","textEn":"Phase noise comes from photon shot noise, sensor read noise, coherent noise from parasitic interference and speckle, and mechanical vibration and air turbulence between the arms. Shot noise sets the single-hologram limit and depends on fringe contrast and photoelectrons per pixel; vibration and thermal drift mainly add piston and tilt across the field, which self-referencing to a flat region removes; the remaining spatial noise comes from coherent noise and curvature-fit residuals and must be budgeted item by item.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget\" is correct?","options":["相位雜訊來自光子散粒雜訊、感測器讀出雜訊、同調雜訊（寄生干涉與散斑）、以及兩臂之間的機械振動與空氣擾動。","相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。","數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。"],"optionsEn":["Phase noise comes from photon shot noise, sensor read noise, coherent noise from parasitic interference and speckle, and mechanical vibration and air turbulence between the arms.","Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.","Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相位雜訊來自光子散粒雜訊、感測器讀出雜訊、同調雜訊（寄生干涉與散斑）、以及兩臂之間的機械振動與空氣擾動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Phase noise comes from photon shot noise, sensor read noise, coherent noise from parasitic interference and speckle, and mechanical vibration and air turbulence between the arms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a424-v12-22","title":"相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：散粒雜訊極限 σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e)：N_e = 20,000 e⁻、V = 0.6 時 σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad，反射式 σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm，100 像素平均後約 0.05 nm。兩臂 10 mm 的空氣路徑差在 dn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K、0.1 K 擾動下產生 1 nm 活塞項，自我參考後殘留取 0.2 nm；RSS 預算 √(0.5² + 0.2² + 0.3²) ≈ 0.62 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Shot-noise limit σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e): with N_e = 20,000 e⁻ and V = 0.6, σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad, so in reflection σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm, or about 0.05 nm after averaging 100 pixels. A 10 mm air-path mismatch with dn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K and 0.1 K fluctuation adds a 1 nm piston, of which 0.2 nm is assumed to remain after self-referencing; the RSS budget √(0.5² + 0.2² + 0.3²) ≈ 0.62 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：連續記錄 100 張平坦鏡面的全像圖，計算每像素相位的時間標準差得到時間雜訊，計算單張相位圖去除活塞與傾斜後的空間標準差得到空間雜訊，並把兩者與散粒雜訊估計及預算表比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record 100 consecutive holograms of a flat mirror, compute the per-pixel temporal standard deviation of phase for temporal noise and the spatial standard deviation of a single phase map after removing piston and tilt for spatial noise, then compare both with the shot-noise estimate and the budget table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"散粒雜訊極限 σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e)：N_e = 20,000 e⁻、V = 0.6 時 σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad，反射式 σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm，100 像素平均後約 0.05 nm。兩臂 10 mm 的空氣路徑差在 dn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K、0.1 K 擾動下產生 1 nm 活塞項，自我參考後殘留取 0.2 nm；RSS 預算 √(0.5² + 0.2² + 0.3²) ≈ 0.62 nm。","textEn":"Shot-noise limit σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e): with N_e = 20,000 e⁻ and V = 0.6, σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad, so in reflection σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm, or about 0.05 nm after averaging 100 pixels. A 10 mm air-path mismatch with dn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K and 0.1 K fluctuation adds a 1 nm piston, of which 0.2 nm is assumed to remain after self-referencing; the RSS budget √(0.5² + 0.2² + 0.3²) ≈ 0.62 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","散粒雜訊極限 σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e)：N_e = 20,000 e⁻、V = 0.6 時 σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad，反射式 σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm，100 像素平均後約 0.05 nm。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。"],"optionsEn":["A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","Shot-noise limit σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e): with N_e = 20,000 e⁻ and V = 0.6, σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad, so in reflection σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm, or about 0.05 nm after averaging 100 pixels.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms."],"answer":1,"explanation":"散粒雜訊極限 σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e)：N_e = 20,000 e⁻、V = 0.6 時 σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad，反射式 σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm，100 像素平均後約 0.05 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Shot-noise limit σ_φ ≈ 1/(V·√N_e): with N_e = 20,000 e⁻ and V = 0.6, σ_φ ≈ 11.8 mrad, so in reflection σ_h = λ·σ_φ/(4π) ≈ 0.50 nm, or about 0.05 nm after averaging 100 pixels. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a424-v12-23","title":"相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"連續記錄 100 張平坦鏡面的全像圖，計算每像素相位的時間標準差得到時間雜訊，計算單張相位圖去除活塞與傾斜後的空間標準差得到空間雜訊，並把兩者與散粒雜訊估計及預算表比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record 100 consecutive holograms of a flat mirror, compute the per-pixel temporal standard deviation of phase for temporal noise and the spatial standard deviation of a single phase map after removing piston and tilt for spatial noise, then compare both with the shot-noise estimate and the budget table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把曝光拉長以增加光子數，卻讓振動在曝光時間內抹平條紋，對比下降反而使相位雜訊上升，整體雜訊比短曝光更差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Lengthening the exposure to collect more photons lets vibration wash out the fringes within the exposure; the lower contrast raises phase noise and the result is worse than a short exposure.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"連續記錄 100 張平坦鏡面的全像圖，計算每像素相位的時間標準差得到時間雜訊，計算單張相位圖去除活塞與傾斜後的空間標準差得到空間雜訊，並把兩者與散粒雜訊估計及預算表比較。","textEn":"Record 100 consecutive holograms of a flat mirror, compute the per-pixel temporal standard deviation of phase for temporal noise and the spatial standard deviation of a single phase map after removing piston and tilt for spatial noise, then compare both with the shot-noise estimate and the budget table.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。","連續記錄 100 張平坦鏡面的全像圖，計算每像素相位的時間標準差得到時間雜訊，計算單張相位圖去除活塞與傾斜後的空間標準差得到空間雜訊，並把兩者與散粒雜訊估計及預算表比較。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.","Record 100 consecutive holograms of a flat mirror, compute the per-pixel temporal standard deviation of phase for temporal noise and the spatial standard deviation of a single phase map after removing piston and tilt for spatial noise, then compare both with the shot-noise estimate and the budget table."],"answer":2,"explanation":"連續記錄 100 張平坦鏡面的全像圖，計算每像素相位的時間標準差得到時間雜訊，計算單張相位圖去除活塞與傾斜後的空間標準差得到空間雜訊，並把兩者與散粒雜訊估計及預算表比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record 100 consecutive holograms of a flat mirror, compute the per-pixel temporal standard deviation of phase for temporal noise and the spatial standard deviation of a single phase map after removing piston and tilt for spatial noise, then compare both with the shot-noise estimate and the budget table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a424-v12-24","title":"相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「時間與空間相位雜訊圖」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Temporal and spatial phase-noise maps” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把曝光拉長以增加光子數，卻讓振動在曝光時間內抹平條紋，對比下降反而使相位雜訊上升，整體雜訊比短曝光更差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Lengthening the exposure to collect more photons lets vibration wash out the fringes within the exposure; the lower contrast raises phase noise and the result is worse than a short exposure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：散粒雜訊決定單張全像圖的極限，與條紋對比和每像素光電子數有關；振動與熱漂移主要造成整場的活塞項與傾斜項，可用視場內的參考平坦區自我參考去除；殘留的空間雜訊則來自同調雜訊與曲率擬合殘差，需分項列入預算。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Shot noise sets the single-hologram limit and depends on fringe contrast and photoelectrons per pixel; vibration and thermal drift mainly add piston and tilt across the field, which self-referencing to a flat region removes; the remaining spatial noise comes from coherent noise and curvature-fit residuals and must be budgeted item by item.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把曝光拉長以增加光子數，卻讓振動在曝光時間內抹平條紋，對比下降反而使相位雜訊上升，整體雜訊比短曝光更差。","textEn":"Lengthening the exposure to collect more photons lets vibration wash out the fringes within the exposure; the lower contrast raises phase noise and the result is worse than a short exposure.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「相位雜訊來源與高度誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Phase-noise sources and the height error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把曝光拉長以增加光子數，卻讓振動在曝光時間內抹平條紋，對比下降反而使相位雜訊上升，整體雜訊比短曝光更差。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。"],"optionsEn":["Lengthening the exposure to collect more photons lets vibration wash out the fringes within the exposure.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把曝光拉長以增加光子數，卻讓振動在曝光時間內抹平條紋，對比下降反而使相位雜訊上升，整體雜訊比短曝光更差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Lengthening the exposure to collect more photons lets vibration wash out the fringes within the exposure; the lower contrast raises phase noise and the result is worse than a short exposure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a424-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「數值重建流程與數值重聚焦」與「系統驗證、比對與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing\" and \"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a424-v12-25","title":"數值重建流程與數值重聚焦：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"重建流程依序為：傅立葉轉換、+1 階濾波與移到中心、乘上曲率補償遮罩、以角譜法或菲涅耳法傳播到像面、取振幅與相位、展開並去除活塞與傾斜。角譜法對波前每個平面波分量乘上傳播因子 exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²))，可精確處理短距離傳播；因為複數波前已被記錄，重聚焦只需改變 d，不必移動樣品，等於把景深延伸到遠超物鏡本身。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The pipeline runs: Fourier transform, +1-order filtering and recentring, multiplication by the curvature mask, propagation to the image plane by the angular-spectrum or Fresnel method, extraction of amplitude and phase, then unwrapping and removal of piston and tilt. The angular-spectrum method multiplies each plane-wave component by exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²)) and handles short propagation distances exactly; because the complex wavefront is recorded, refocusing only changes d without moving the sample, extending the usable depth far beyond the objective's own depth of field. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：像空間傳播距離換算到物空間為 Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²：M = 40、Δz_img = 16 mm 時 Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Propagation in image space converts to object space as Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²: with M = 40 and Δz_img = 16 mm, Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm.","failure":"常見誤解：「數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-25-k1","title":"數值重建流程與數值重聚焦","titleEn":"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing","text":"重建流程依序為：傅立葉轉換、+1 階濾波與移到中心、乘上曲率補償遮罩、以角譜法或菲涅耳法傳播到像面、取振幅與相位、展開並去除活塞與傾斜。角譜法對波前每個平面波分量乘上傳播因子 exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²))，可精確處理短距離傳播；因為複數波前已被記錄，重聚焦只需改變 d，不必移動樣品，等於把景深延伸到遠超物鏡本身。","textEn":"The pipeline runs: Fourier transform, +1-order filtering and recentring, multiplication by the curvature mask, propagation to the image plane by the angular-spectrum or Fresnel method, extraction of amplitude and phase, then unwrapping and removal of piston and tilt. The angular-spectrum method multiplies each plane-wave component by exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²)) and handles short propagation distances exactly; because the complex wavefront is recorded, refocusing only changes d without moving the sample, extending the usable depth far beyond the objective's own depth of field.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「數值重建流程與數值重聚焦」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing\" is correct?","options":["數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。","重建流程依序為：傅立葉轉換、+1 階濾波與移到中心、乘上曲率補償遮罩、以角譜法或菲涅耳法傳播到像面、取振幅與相位、展開並去除活塞與傾斜。","台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective.","The pipeline runs: Fourier transform, +1-order filtering and recentring, multiplication by the curvature mask, propagation to the image plane by the angular-spectrum or Fresnel method, extraction of amplitude and phase, then unwrapping and removal of piston and tilt.","One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重建流程依序為：傅立葉轉換、+1 階濾波與移到中心、乘上曲率補償遮罩、以角譜法或菲涅耳法傳播到像面、取振幅與相位、展開並去除活塞與傾斜。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The pipeline runs: Fourier transform, +1-order filtering and recentring, multiplication by the curvature mask, propagation to the image plane by the angular-spectrum or Fresnel method, extraction of amplitude and phase, then unwrapping and removal of piston and tilt. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a424-v12-26","title":"數值重建流程與數值重聚焦：定量估算","titleEn":"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：像空間傳播距離換算到物空間為 Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²：M = 40、Δz_img = 16 mm 時 Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm。物鏡本身的景深約 n·λ/NA² = 0.532/0.65² ≈ 1.26 µm，所以數值重聚焦把可用深度擴大約 8 倍，而不改變橫向解析度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Propagation in image space converts to object space as Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²: with M = 40 and Δz_img = 16 mm, Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm. The objective's own depth of field is about n·λ/NA² = 0.532/0.65² ≈ 1.26 µm, so numerical refocusing extends the usable depth roughly 8 times without changing lateral resolution. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：記錄一片傾斜放置的解析力標板，單張全像圖以不同 d 重建並以振幅方差或稀疏度指標自動對焦，確認各區域的最佳 d 隨位置線性變化且斜率符合 M² 換算；再與機械移動載物台得到的焦點位置比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record a tilted resolution target, reconstruct the single hologram at several d values with an autofocus metric such as amplitude variance or sparsity, confirm that the best d varies linearly across the field with a slope matching the M² conversion, and compare with focus positions found by moving the stage mechanically.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"像空間傳播距離換算到物空間為 Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²：M = 40、Δz_img = 16 mm 時 Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm。物鏡本身的景深約 n·λ/NA² = 0.532/0.65² ≈ 1.26 µm，所以數值重聚焦把可用深度擴大約 8 倍，而不改變橫向解析度。","textEn":"Propagation in image space converts to object space as Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²: with M = 40 and Δz_img = 16 mm, Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm. The objective's own depth of field is about n·λ/NA² = 0.532/0.65² ≈ 1.26 µm, so numerical refocusing extends the usable depth roughly 8 times without changing lateral resolution.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「數值重建流程與數值重聚焦」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing\", which statement holds?","options":["只要相位圖連續，量到的高度就不會有 2π 含糊。","數值補償可以修正任何物鏡像差，所以物鏡品質不重要。","像空間傳播距離換算到物空間為 Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²：M = 40、Δz_img = 16 mm 時 Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm。"],"optionsEn":["If the phase map looks continuous the measured height cannot have a 2π ambiguity.","Numerical compensation can fix any objective aberration, so objective quality does not matter.","Propagation in image space converts to object space as Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²: with M = 40 and Δz_img = 16 mm, Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"像空間傳播距離換算到物空間為 Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²：M = 40、Δz_img = 16 mm 時 Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Propagation in image space converts to object space as Δz_obj = Δz_img/M²: with M = 40 and Δz_img = 16 mm, Δz_obj = 16/1600 mm = 10 µm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a424-v12-27","title":"數值重建流程與數值重聚焦：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"記錄一片傾斜放置的解析力標板，單張全像圖以不同 d 重建並以振幅方差或稀疏度指標自動對焦，確認各區域的最佳 d 隨位置線性變化且斜率符合 M² 換算；再與機械移動載物台得到的焦點位置比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record a tilted resolution target, reconstruct the single hologram at several d values with an autofocus metric such as amplitude variance or sparsity, confirm that the best d varies linearly across the field with a slope matching the M² conversion, and compare with focus positions found by moving the stage mechanically. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：傳播距離取錯符號或在角譜法中忽略消逝波項，會得到看似清晰但相位錯誤的影像；若 d 偏離真正像面數微米，邊緣會出現繞射環並把相位台階弄圓。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A wrong sign of the propagation distance, or neglecting the evanescent terms in the angular-spectrum method, yields images that look sharp but carry wrong phase; a d a few micrometres off the true image plane adds diffraction rings at edges and rounds phase steps.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄一片傾斜放置的解析力標板，單張全像圖以不同 d 重建並以振幅方差或稀疏度指標自動對焦，確認各區域的最佳 d 隨位置線性變化且斜率符合 M² 換算；再與機械移動載物台得到的焦點位置比較。","textEn":"Record a tilted resolution target, reconstruct the single hologram at several d values with an autofocus metric such as amplitude variance or sparsity, confirm that the best d varies linearly across the field with a slope matching the M² conversion, and compare with focus positions found by moving the stage mechanically.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「數值重建流程與數值重聚焦」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing\"?","options":["記錄一片傾斜放置的解析力標板，單張全像圖以不同 d 重建並以振幅方差或稀疏度指標自動對焦，確認各區域的最佳 d 隨位置線性變化且斜率符合 M² 換算。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。"],"optionsEn":["Record a tilted resolution target, reconstruct the single hologram at several d values with an autofocus metric such as amplitude variance or sparsity, confirm that the best d varies linearly across the field with a slope matching the M² conversion, and compare with focus positions found by moving the stage mechanically.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index."],"answer":0,"explanation":"記錄一片傾斜放置的解析力標板，單張全像圖以不同 d 重建並以振幅方差或稀疏度指標自動對焦，確認各區域的最佳 d 隨位置線性變化且斜率符合 M² 換算；再與機械移動載物台得到的焦點位置比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record a tilted resolution target, reconstruct the single hologram at several d values with an autofocus metric such as amplitude variance or sparsity, confirm that the best d varies linearly across the field with a slope matching the M² conversion, and compare with focus positions found by moving the stage mechanically. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a424-v12-28","title":"數值重建流程與數值重聚焦：失效診斷","titleEn":"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「角譜重建與數值重聚焦」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Angular-spectrum reconstruction and numerical refocusing” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"傳播距離取錯符號或在角譜法中忽略消逝波項，會得到看似清晰但相位錯誤的影像；若 d 偏離真正像面數微米，邊緣會出現繞射環並把相位台階弄圓。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A wrong sign of the propagation distance, or neglecting the evanescent terms in the angular-spectrum method, yields images that look sharp but carry wrong phase; a d a few micrometres off the true image plane adds diffraction rings at edges and rounds phase steps. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：角譜法對波前每個平面波分量乘上傳播因子 exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²))，可精確處理短距離傳播；因為複數波前已被記錄，重聚焦只需改變 d，不必移動樣品，等於把景深延伸到遠超物鏡本身。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The angular-spectrum method multiplies each plane-wave component by exp(i·2π·d·√(1/λ² − f²)) and handles short propagation distances exactly; because the complex wavefront is recorded, refocusing only changes d without moving the sample, extending the usable depth far beyond the objective's own depth of field.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「數值重聚焦可以無限制延伸景深，不受物鏡限制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Numerical refocusing extends the depth of field without limit regardless of the objective.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"傳播距離取錯符號或在角譜法中忽略消逝波項，會得到看似清晰但相位錯誤的影像；若 d 偏離真正像面數微米，邊緣會出現繞射環並把相位台階弄圓。","textEn":"A wrong sign of the propagation distance, or neglecting the evanescent terms in the angular-spectrum method, yields images that look sharp but carry wrong phase; a d a few micrometres off the true image plane adds diffraction rings at edges and rounds phase steps.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「數值重建流程與數值重聚焦」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Numerical reconstruction pipeline and numerical refocusing\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","傳播距離取錯符號或在角譜法中忽略消逝波項，會得到看似清晰但相位錯誤的影像；若 d 偏離真正像面數微米，邊緣會出現繞射環並把相位台階弄圓。","台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A wrong sign of the propagation distance, or neglecting the evanescent terms in the angular-spectrum method, yields images that look sharp but carry wrong phase.","One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"傳播距離取錯符號或在角譜法中忽略消逝波項，會得到看似清晰但相位錯誤的影像；若 d 偏離真正像面數微米，邊緣會出現繞射環並把相位台階弄圓。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A wrong sign of the propagation distance, or neglecting the evanescent terms in the angular-spectrum method, yields images that look sharp but carry wrong phase; a d a few micrometres off the true image plane adds diffraction rings at edges and rounds phase steps. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a424-v12-29","title":"系統驗證、比對與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「驗收報告與重建參數檔」如何決定數位全像顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file” determines the key performance of “Digital holographic microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"驗收不是只看單一指標，而是把橫向解析度、高度準確度、時間與空間雜訊、視場、重聚焦範圍與重建參數一起記錄。高度準確度用認證台階片與相符性指標 E_n 判定；解析度用標板的最小可分辨線對；雜訊用平坦鏡面連拍；重建參數檔（波長、像素尺寸、傳播距離、濾波視窗、補償遮罩）必須版本化存檔，否則同一張全像圖日後無法重現相同結果。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「驗收報告與重建參數檔」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Acceptance is not a single number but a record of lateral resolution, height accuracy, temporal and spatial noise, field of view, refocusing range and reconstruction parameters together. Height accuracy is judged with a certified step and the E_n compatibility index; resolution with the smallest resolved line pair of a target; noise with repeated flat-mirror captures; and the reconstruction parameter file (wavelength, pixel size, propagation distance, filter window, compensation mask) must be versioned, otherwise the same hologram cannot be reproduced later. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：相符性指標 E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²)，U 為 k = 2 擴充不確定度。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The compatibility index is E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²) with U the k = 2 expanded uncertainty.","failure":"常見誤解：「台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「驗收報告與重建參數檔」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-29-k1","title":"系統驗證、比對與工程交接","titleEn":"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff","text":"驗收不是只看單一指標，而是把橫向解析度、高度準確度、時間與空間雜訊、視場、重聚焦範圍與重建參數一起記錄。高度準確度用認證台階片與相符性指標 E_n 判定；解析度用標板的最小可分辨線對；雜訊用平坦鏡面連拍；重建參數檔（波長、像素尺寸、傳播距離、濾波視窗、補償遮罩）必須版本化存檔，否則同一張全像圖日後無法重現相同結果。","textEn":"Acceptance is not a single number but a record of lateral resolution, height accuracy, temporal and spatial noise, field of view, refocusing range and reconstruction parameters together. Height accuracy is judged with a certified step and the E_n compatibility index; resolution with the smallest resolved line pair of a target; noise with repeated flat-mirror captures; and the reconstruction parameter file (wavelength, pixel size, propagation distance, filter window, compensation mask) must be versioned, otherwise the same hologram cannot be reproduced later.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「系統驗證、比對與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。","載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","驗收不是只看單一指標，而是把橫向解析度、高度準確度、時間與空間雜訊、視場、重聚焦範圍與重建參數一起記錄。"],"optionsEn":["One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted.","A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","Acceptance is not a single number but a record of lateral resolution, height accuracy, temporal and spatial noise, field of view, refocusing range and reconstruction parameters together."],"answer":2,"explanation":"驗收不是只看單一指標，而是把橫向解析度、高度準確度、時間與空間雜訊、視場、重聚焦範圍與重建參數一起記錄。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Acceptance is not a single number but a record of lateral resolution, height accuracy, temporal and spatial noise, field of view, refocusing range and reconstruction parameters together. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a424-v12-30","title":"系統驗證、比對與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「驗收報告與重建參數檔」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：相符性指標 E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²)，U 為 k = 2 擴充不確定度。台階證書 100.0 nm、U_ref = 2.0 nm，實驗室量得 100.8 nm、U_lab = 1.2 nm，E_n = 0.8/√(1.44 + 4.0) = 0.8/2.33 ≈ 0.34 \u003c 1，判定相符；若 E_n 超過 1 就必須找出未計入的系統誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The compatibility index is E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²) with U the k = 2 expanded uncertainty. For a certified 100.0 nm step with U_ref = 2.0 nm and a laboratory result of 100.8 nm with U_lab = 1.2 nm, E_n = 0.8/√(1.44 + 4.0) = 0.8/2.33 ≈ 0.34 \u003c 1, so the results agree; an E_n above 1 means an unaccounted systematic error must be found. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：執行驗收清單：台階片三次重複量測與 E_n 計算、解析力標板最小線對、100 張連拍的時間雜訊、單張的空間雜訊、傾斜標板的重聚焦範圍，並把每項結果連同重建參數檔與原始全像圖一起歸檔。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run the acceptance list: three repeated step measurements with E_n, the smallest resolved line pair on the target, temporal noise from 100 captures, spatial noise from a single map, refocusing range on a tilted target, and archive every result together with the reconstruction parameter file and the raw holograms.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"相符性指標 E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²)，U 為 k = 2 擴充不確定度。台階證書 100.0 nm、U_ref = 2.0 nm，實驗室量得 100.8 nm、U_lab = 1.2 nm，E_n = 0.8/√(1.44 + 4.0) = 0.8/2.33 ≈ 0.34 \u003c 1，判定相符；若 E_n 超過 1 就必須找出未計入的系統誤差。","textEn":"The compatibility index is E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²) with U the k = 2 expanded uncertainty. For a certified 100.0 nm step with U_ref = 2.0 nm and a laboratory result of 100.8 nm with U_lab = 1.2 nm, E_n = 0.8/√(1.44 + 4.0) = 0.8/2.33 ≈ 0.34 \u003c 1, so the results agree; an E_n above 1 means an unaccounted systematic error must be found.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「系統驗證、比對與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["相符性指標 E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²)，U 為 k = 2 擴充不確定度。","同調長度越長的雷射，全像品質一定越好。","定量相位影像直接給出厚度，不需要知道折射率。"],"optionsEn":["The compatibility index is E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²) with U the k = 2 expanded uncertainty.","A laser with longer coherence length always gives better holograms.","Quantitative phase imaging gives thickness directly without knowing the refractive index."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相符性指標 E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²)，U 為 k = 2 擴充不確定度。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The compatibility index is E_n = |h_lab − h_ref|/√(U_lab² + U_ref²) with U the k = 2 expanded uncertainty. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a424-v12-31","title":"系統驗證、比對與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「驗收報告與重建參數檔」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"執行驗收清單：台階片三次重複量測與 E_n 計算、解析力標板最小線對、100 張連拍的時間雜訊、單張的空間雜訊、傾斜標板的重聚焦範圍，並把每項結果連同重建參數檔與原始全像圖一起歸檔。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run the acceptance list: three repeated step measurements with E_n, the smallest resolved line pair on the target, temporal noise from 100 captures, spatial noise from a single map, refocusing range on a tilted target, and archive every result together with the reconstruction parameter file and the raw holograms. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只存重建後的相位圖而不存原始全像圖與參數檔，日後發現曲率補償或濾波視窗設錯時無法重算，整批量測資料必須作廢重測。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Storing only reconstructed phase maps without the raw holograms and parameter file means that when a wrong compensation mask or filter window is found later nothing can be recomputed, and the whole batch must be re-measured.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"執行驗收清單：台階片三次重複量測與 E_n 計算、解析力標板最小線對、100 張連拍的時間雜訊、單張的空間雜訊、傾斜標板的重聚焦範圍，並把每項結果連同重建參數檔與原始全像圖一起歸檔。","textEn":"Run the acceptance list: three repeated step measurements with E_n, the smallest resolved line pair on the target, temporal noise from 100 captures, spatial noise from a single map, refocusing range on a tilted target, and archive every result together with the reconstruction parameter file and the raw holograms.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「系統驗證、比對與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","執行驗收清單：台階片三次重複量測與 E_n 計算、解析力標板最小線對、100 張連拍的時間雜訊、單張的空間雜訊、傾斜標板的重聚焦範圍，並把每項結果連同重建參數檔與原始全像圖一起歸檔。","相位雜訊只由相機雜訊決定，與光學裝調無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run the acceptance list: three repeated step measurements with E_n, the smallest resolved line pair on the target, temporal noise from 100 captures, spatial noise from a single map, refocusing range on a tilted target, and archive every result together with the reconstruction parameter file and the raw holograms.","Phase noise is set by the camera alone and has nothing to do with optical alignment."],"answer":1,"explanation":"執行驗收清單：台階片三次重複量測與 E_n 計算、解析力標板最小線對、100 張連拍的時間雜訊、單張的空間雜訊、傾斜標板的重聚焦範圍，並把每項結果連同重建參數檔與原始全像圖一起歸檔。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run the acceptance list: three repeated step measurements with E_n, the smallest resolved line pair on the target, temporal noise from 100 captures, spatial noise from a single map, refocusing range on a tilted target, and archive every result together with the reconstruction parameter file and the raw holograms. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a424-v12-32","title":"系統驗證、比對與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"prerequisiteIds":["a424-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「驗收報告與重建參數檔」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Acceptance record and reconstruction parameter file” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只存重建後的相位圖而不存原始全像圖與參數檔，日後發現曲率補償或濾波視窗設錯時無法重算，整批量測資料必須作廢重測。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Storing only reconstructed phase maps without the raw holograms and parameter file means that when a wrong compensation mask or filter window is found later nothing can be recomputed, and the whole batch must be re-measured. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：高度準確度用認證台階片與相符性指標 E_n 判定；解析度用標板的最小可分辨線對；雜訊用平坦鏡面連拍；重建參數檔（波長、像素尺寸、傳播距離、濾波視窗、補償遮罩）必須版本化存檔，否則同一張全像圖日後無法重現相同結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Height accuracy is judged with a certified step and the E_n compatibility index; resolution with the smallest resolved line pair of a target; noise with repeated flat-mirror captures; and the reconstruction parameter file (wavelength, pixel size, propagation distance, filter window, compensation mask) must be versioned, otherwise the same hologram cannot be reproduced later.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「台階片量測一次正確，整台系統就驗收完成。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One correct step measurement means the whole system is accepted.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a424-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只存重建後的相位圖而不存原始全像圖與參數檔，日後發現曲率補償或濾波視窗設錯時無法重算，整批量測資料必須作廢重測。","textEn":"Storing only reconstructed phase maps without the raw holograms and parameter file means that when a wrong compensation mask or filter window is found later nothing can be recomputed, and the whole batch must be re-measured.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]},{"id":"a424-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「系統驗證、比對與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System validation, comparison and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","載波頻率越高，分離越乾淨，所以參考光角度應盡量大。","只存重建後的相位圖而不存原始全像圖與參數檔，日後發現曲率補償或濾波視窗設錯時無法重算，整批量測資料必須作廢重測。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A higher carrier always separates orders better, so the reference angle should be as large as possible.","Storing only reconstructed phase maps without the raw holograms and parameter file means that when a wrong compensation mask or filter window is found later nothing can be recomputed, and the whole batch must be re-measured."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只存重建後的相位圖而不存原始全像圖與參數檔，日後發現曲率補償或濾波視窗設錯時無法重算，整批量測資料必須作廢重測。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Storing only reconstructed phase maps without the raw holograms and parameter file means that when a wrong compensation mask or filter window is found later nothing can be recomputed, and the whole batch must be re-measured. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-lynceetec-dhm","v12o-tomocube-holotomography","v12o-holomonitor-qpi","v12o-wiki-dhm"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
